     MOVE "1 1 15" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "RS3-SENSOR-ANALOG" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 0 0 0 15" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 30-8§4 Sculk sensor block: worked example 11.1 (11): sensor radius 8 hears a step 3 blocks away: strength 10 (distance squared 9), the active phase for 30 ticks and the inactive" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
